{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "9bdb454931033aeff91eaf118c11f53779dd1aaf6af3e03102324bd4ef107ddb", "ja": "はい、ばっちりです！　デザインも、\nとってもかわいくて……素敵ですよね～♪", "zh": "嗯，很合身！\n设计也很可爱……真的很棒～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1afc1169b4f0d0e503e5a381c60ed36b9ad9ac89ff7c53eec55667abf170247c", "ja": "それに、春香によく似合ってるしな。その衣装を着た\n春香のステージは、何度見ても楽しいだろうな。", "zh": "而且也非常适合春香呢。只要春香穿上这套服装表演，\n肯定让人百看不厌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "f6c4e3f9d341e7d488721685de5553f1fb05b00b1652319dd212773e72855c70", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございます♪\nそうですよね……。私、がんばらないとだめですよね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你♪\n也对……我得好好加油才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bfb1d0eebf3b980b223a6ef7c7e57e09d8586d6595a6bba24963e7c861680755", "ja": "え？　急にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "咦？怎么突然这样说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "2a2f411b5fd785e4c4d02d1f6b2f6bcad47b26ac0276ef2d7ea3054600983065", "ja": "あ、あの、えっと……、なんていうか……。", "zh": "啊，那个，呃……该怎么说才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "938b85d07bb52c2e3f74d9933accc4dcb58bc276a599b329e7497eb73f10ad58", "ja": "この衣装って、私用にデザインしてくれたんですよね？\n1人でそんなの着ちゃって、いいのかな～って……。", "zh": "这套服装是为了我而设计的对吧？\n可是我总觉得，只让我一个人穿真的好吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "791ef23ee03c5f7e8ad22c181d482ebefc3828fe821f5a71ccf71ec368ccd53a", "ja": "あ、もちろん{$P$}さんには、\n感謝してますっ。とってもうれしいんですけど……。", "zh": "啊，我当然很感谢{$P$}先生喔。\n这真的让我非常开心，但……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3935318d4a0e82b7d1b2af369126b36d1cc71c136e3a5b2fb2112d5e22a82211", "ja": "なるほど、特別扱いされて落ち着かないのか。\nでも、ちなみに……。", "zh": "原来如此，因为受到特别对待，所以会觉得不安是吗。\n不过，让我说句题外话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a03641b3149002e458f4553e81b444cc3dbd8612c0d07ffdf335c9dc502bef6e", "ja": "実はその衣装、デザインしたのは\n劇場の後輩たちなんだ。", "zh": "其实那套服装，\n是剧场的后辈们设计的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0a67e98037310452677354913b73946090876ae18d094cd0a56ebcfbe9ab72ef", "ja": "ああ。みんなで色々なアイデアを出しあって、\n春香の魅力を一番引き立たせるデザインを考えてな。", "zh": "没错，大家一起集思广益，\n想出了最能衬托出春香魅力的设计。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "baa0f902b4e94221f22cf829d686d365195a3abfb506a4bafe412ccb33562c98", "ja": "そ、そんな……。どうして……？", "zh": "居、居然……为什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a9ddc5aaca41aa4e7ae5bae4be17118f448fb58f1a472df6a294ef9ff80e9b18", "ja": "新人たちが来てから、春香はいつもみんなに\n目を配って、フォローをしてくれていただろ？", "zh": "自从新人们进来之后，你不是一直关照着大家，\n给了她们许多协助吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1014_p", "source_sha256": "21ab2fa9366cc92d0513f9055466545aaa31c1202d3acaa4777a8e1c321c4df6", "ja": "みんな、そんな春香に、すごく感謝してたんだよ。\nそれを形にしたくて、俺に相談してきたんだ。", "zh": "大家都非常感谢春香的照顾喔。\n所以她们为了实际表达谢意，才会来找我商量的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "8705910e97441391de17cb1e9cc987b57d1b0a8e6883191efa52715a55407fb6", "ja": "わぁ……！\nみんな……、ありがとう……！", "zh": "哇啊……！\n大家……谢谢你们……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1016_p", "source_sha256": "385f18f1454acab4f7107d2283f9233a770d96c9d8ba77a25a7e75bd86f5bd4a", "ja": "あ、しまった！", "zh": "啊，糟了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "fa3eeb9d543cbf6eeed6f1367c70fc7a3622717c7a72b4b9a2e522bd0aaedbff", "ja": "え？　ど、どうしたんですか？", "zh": "咦？怎、怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1018_p", "source_sha256": "68a14618a5b1a5a72dd187d14f826363afe3de233ec938a3aa47f8c7c5e496c7", "ja": "春香には黙っててくれって、言われてたんだった……。\n今の、聞かなかったことにしてくれないか？", "zh": "她们交代过我不能把这件事告诉春香……\n刚才那些话，你可以当作没听到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "903fb438d90c7483ff70d7872e9cbf29e9e1d3f1bc3f915692b6ab350b8c6d97", "ja": "ええっ！？　そんな器用なことできませんよ～！\nもうっ、{$P$}さんってばっ。", "zh": "咦！？这种事我装不来啦～！\n唉，{$P$}先生真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "3c62ea0f421fac8bf07041c5bec246027480a398f9f4a64f2c8a667e1cb381eb", "ja": "とにかく、そういうことなら……この衣装を着た\nステージで、失敗なんて絶対できませんよね？", "zh": "总而言之，既然是这么一回事……\n我穿着这套服装上台表演时，就绝对不能失败啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0034_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "9e9ccdfb85b4cee775cb220954678a14cbf5ff70568bc04a37df08b1ba5ec190", "ja": "よ～し……。{$P$}さんっ、\n今から特別レッスン、お願いします！", "zh": "好～{$P$}先生，\n麻烦你帮我从现在开始安排特别训练课程！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
